      "position": 3,
      "section": "What I’m watching —",
      "category": "video",
      "title": "The Greatest Movie Ever Sold",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "Produced by and starring my [podcast guest Morgan\nSpurlock](http://www.fourhournewsletter.com/click.html?x=a62e&lc=wMG&mc=e&s=bomwH&u=w&y=M&),\nthis doc has been on my to-watch list for a while. In this documentary,\nSpurlock is biting the hand that feeds him by exposing Hollywood's dirtiest\nlittle secret: the games they play to get advertisers' products strategically\nplaced in movies and on television. Spurlock uses his irreverent style to\ninfiltrate corporate boardrooms and ad agency pitches. Super meta and very\nfunny.",
